Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 03:04:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 21/21] Restore Windows desktop icon layout after Switch
 migration

Read the optional desktopLayout manifest field, remap shortcuts to their actual restored names, and apply column flow and manual grid positions after PWA launchers exist. Keep icons movable and retry when plasmashell is unavailable. Plasma always snaps icons to grid cells; pixel-level free placement is approximated.

Validation: Node layout tests, Qt QJSEngine evaluation, auth helper compilation, and existing preferences tests.
